From c59abd18dbe5c98e539649f66135b1b966860e48 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Basin Battle <basin@battle>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 11:36:19 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] SetWorldFog and ClearWorldFog: an add-on sets the outdoor fog
 and gloom; HasActionCombat() is 12

SetWorldFog(r, g, b, fogEnd, startFrac, weight, seconds[, darken]) blends the zone's outdoor
scene fog toward that colour and distance by weight, eased over seconds, and darken dims the
ambient light, the sun and the sky toward a Duskwood gloom; the sky dome leans toward the fog
colour so the horizon meets it. ClearWorldFog([seconds]) eases back to the zone's own. A
building's own fog still takes over inside it, water keeps its own, and leaving the world clears
it. Elwynn Survival drives it from the server's tuning.
